#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "For the definition of the Gamma function, see B<tgamma>(3)."
msgstr ""
"Para obtener una explicación de la función Gamma, consulte B<tgamma>(3)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<lgamma()> function returns the natural logarithm of the absolute "
#| "value of the Gamma function.  The sign of the Gamma function is returned "
#| "in the external integer I<signgam> declared in I<E<lt>math.hE<gt>>.  It "
#| "is 1 when the Gamma function is positive or zero, -1 when it is negative."
msgid ""
"The B<lgamma>(), B<lgammaf>(), and B<lgammal>()  functions return the "
"natural logarithm of the absolute value of the Gamma function.  The sign of "
"the Gamma function is returned in the external integer I<signgam> declared "
"in I<E<lt>math.hE<gt>>.  It is 1 when the Gamma function is positive or "
"zero, -1 when it is negative."
msgstr ""
"La función B<lgamma()> devuelve el logaritmo natural del valor absoluto de "
"la función Gamma.  El signo de la función Gamma se devuelve en la variable "
"entera externo I<signgam> declarado en I<E<lt>math.hE<gt>>.  Vale 1 cuando "
"la función Gamma es positiva o cero, -1 cuando es negativa."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Since using a constant location I<signgam> is not thread-safe, the "
#| "functions B<lgamma_r()> etc. have been introduced; they return this sign "
#| "via the parameter I<signp>."
msgid ""
"Since using a constant location I<signgam> is not thread-safe, the functions "
"B<lgamma_r>(), B<lgammaf_r>(), and B<lgammal_r>()  have been introduced; "
"they return the sign via the argument I<signp>."
msgstr ""
"Ya que usar una localización constante I<signgam> no se considera hilo-"
"seguro, se han introducido las funciones B<lgamma_r()> etc.; devuelven el "
"signo en el parámetro I<signp>."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
